  (descr "M5StampS3/S3A socket: 1.27mm-pitch female pin headers 17P + 11P, row spacing 17.2mm. Pad positions measured from official M5Stack Stamp-S3-SMD footprint. Solder 1.27mm female headers (or cut-to-length socket rails) here; solder male 1.27mm pins to the Stamp castellations and plug in. Module underside GND pads 29-31 of the bare module are NOT connected in socket configuration.")
